<h2><span data-i18n="review.common.overview">Overview</span></h2>
<p>DeepSeek Chat has emerged as a powerful AI chatbot that rivals industry leaders like GPT-4 and Claude, offering exceptional reasoning capabilities with a focus on coding and mathematical problem-solving. Built on the DeepSeek-V3 model, this open-source platform delivers impressive performance at a fraction of the cost of comparable alternatives.</p>
<p>What sets DeepSeek apart is its strong reasoning engine that excels at complex problem-solving, particularly in technical domains. The model demonstrates remarkable proficiency in coding tasks, mathematical reasoning, and logical analysis. With support for over 100 languages and a generous free tier, DeepSeek has quickly gained traction among developers, researchers, and technical users worldwide.</p>
<p>The platform's commitment to open-source development and transparency has made it a favorite in the AI community. Whether you're debugging code, solving complex math problems, or engaging in technical discussions, DeepSeek Chat provides accurate, well-reasoned responses that compete with the best proprietary models.</p>
